  "title": "Impossibly Easy Pizza Bake",
  "description": "Craving pizza? Just add milk to Original Bisquick mix and you'll make quick work of a pizza bake that's in the oven in less than 20 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Bisquick"
  ],
  "date_published": "2014-07-25T16:09:43-04:00",
